1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,291
Hi, I'm Yezir Hasan.

2
00:00:03,041 --> 00:00:04,196
I studied mass communication,

3
00:00:04,196 --> 00:00:06,506
and for more than three years I've been turning complicated

4
00:00:06,506 --> 00:00:09,082
crypto and AI products into stories people actually understand.

5
00:00:09,532 --> 00:00:10,379
This is my work.

6
00:00:10,379 --> 00:00:13,519
Hackathon demos, product explainers, launch videos and series.

7
00:00:13,519 --> 00:00:15,612
Every number checked, every claim true.

8
00:00:18,661 --> 00:00:21,304
Lately, almost everything I cover involves AI agents.

9
00:00:21,304 --> 00:00:23,408
Agents that hold wallets, read your posts,

10
00:00:23,408 --> 00:00:24,684
and act on your behalf.

11
00:00:25,135 --> 00:00:27,265
So when I built my own agent, StrikeAGent,

12
00:00:27,265 --> 00:00:29,443
a paper trading bot on X, safety came first.

13
00:00:29,443 --> 00:00:32,106
Strict commands instead of guesswork, verified events,

14
00:00:32,106 --> 00:00:34,289
and only you can touch your own positions.

15
00:00:34,938 --> 00:00:36,582
That's why ArmorIQ stood out to me.

16
00:00:36,582 --> 00:00:39,114
Every tool call an agent makes, planned, policy checked,

17
00:00:39,114 --> 00:00:39,781
and auditable.

18
00:00:39,781 --> 00:00:42,330
That's the layer builders in my community are missing.

19
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:44,040
In my first ninety days,

20
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:45,906
I'd explain ArmorIQ in videos and threads,

21
00:00:45,906 --> 00:00:47,391
build an open source demo with it,

22
00:00:47,391 --> 00:00:48,918
and host a live session on securing

23
00:00:48,918 --> 00:00:50,340
your agent before you ship it.

24
00:00:50,990 --> 00:00:51,805
I'm Yezir Hasan.

25
00:00:51,805 --> 00:00:53,632
Let's make agents people can trust.
